Package: ontologyAPI
Title: REST and MCP Servers for Ontology-Based R Packages
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cathal", "Byrne", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cathal@example.com")
Description: Serves an 'ontologySpecR' bundle and its data over two protocols
    from one shared set of handlers: a JSON REST API (via 'plumber') and a
    Model Context Protocol (MCP) server over stdio or server-sent events.
    Python, TypeScript and LLM agents can query object sets, traverse links,
    evaluate concepts, and submit actions without writing R.
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
